    the way CachyOS packages them (CachyOS-PKGBUILDS cachyos-ananicy-rules/PKGBUILD, commit 0c7ddbc13573 of 2026-11-16): the repository's files into
    /etc/ananicy.d without README.md, sort-games.sh, the two JSON schemas, lint.py and Makefile. ORDER 108 (Daniel, 2026-10-05: "processor
    governance"). Its default configuration is the upstream ananicy.conf (check_freq = 15 and the rest) as the rules repository ships it.
  * The files are configuration files: a person's change to a rule is kept by dpkg.

